{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"15316","name":"Divani Apollon Palace and Thalasso","description":"A landmark on the Athenian Riviera’s finest spot, this iconic 5-star hotel offers guests modern design, a tranquil atmosphere, and stunning sea views. Guests can enjoy unique rooms and suites, a variety of seafront or poolside bars and restaurants offering delectable dishes and cocktails, and a wealth of leisure activities. Indulgence continues with premium outdoor swimming pools, as well as a private sandy beach boasting thrilling water sports and private yacht cruises. At the heart of it all lies the world-class Divani Athens Spa & Thalasso Center, the ultimate destination for wellness and rejuvenation, featuring the sole thalassotherapy retreat in Athens, an abundance of signature spa therapies, and Greece’s best Fitness Center.","address":"Agiou Nikolaou And Iliou Street, 10","city":"VOULIAGMENI","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"166 71","lat":37.828108,"lng":23.771174,"stars":5,"chain":"DIVHO","giataCode":"11534","phone":"+302108911100","email":"INFO@DIVANIAPOLLON.GR","website":"https://divaniapollonhotel.com/","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/015316/015316a_hb_a_033_20260827_114351.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/015316/015316a_hb_a_034_20260827_114353.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/015316/015316a_hb_a_035_20260827_114408.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/015316/015316a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/015316/015316a_hb_l_002.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/015316/015316a_hb_w_005.jpg","category":"room","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/015316/015316a_hb_w_003.jpg","category":"room","order":6},{"url":"htt